{"schema":"mao-cross-channel-public-site-data/1","script":"0009","rows":[{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0009:00000125:text","row":3910,"ordinal":1,"kind":"text","jp":"「……ははは、先週そういえば、落雷を伴う激しい雨の日がありましたか」","en":"“...Ha ha. Come to think of it, didn’t we have a violent thunderstorm last week?”","speakerJa":"桜庭","speakerEn":"Sakuraba","ghs":[]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0009:000001ea:text","row":3911,"ordinal":2,"kind":"text","jp":"「…………」","en":"“...”","speakerJa":"曜子","speakerEn":"Yoko","ghs":[]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0009:00000233:text","row":3912,"ordinal":3,"kind":"text","jp":"「避雷針の代わりに、アンテナが思い切り雷をキャッチしたんですね」","en":"“The antenna caught the lightning bolt in place of the lightning rod.”","speakerJa":"桜庭","speakerEn":"Sakuraba","ghs":[]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0009:00000293:text","row":3913,"ordinal":4,"kind":"text","jp":"「…………」","en":"“...”","speakerJa":"曜子","speakerEn":"Yoko","ghs":[]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0009:000002dc:text","row":3914,"ordinal":5,"kind":"text","jp":"「ありがとう、アンテナ！　君の尊い犠牲を、我々人類は決して忘れない……」","en":"“Thank you, brave antenna! Humanity shall never forget your noble sacrifice...”","speakerJa":"桜庭","speakerEn":"Sakuraba","ghs":[]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0009:00000344:text","row":3915,"ordinal":6,"kind":"text","jp":"「…………」","en":"“...”","speakerJa":"曜子","speakerEn":"Yoko","ghs":[]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0009:00000370:text","row":3916,"ordinal":7,"kind":"text","jp":"「…………」","en":"“...”","speakerJa":"桜庭","speakerEn":"Sakuraba","ghs":[]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0009:000003b9:text","row":3917,"ordinal":8,"kind":"text","jp":"「……部活、できないわね」","en":"“...So much for club activities.”","speakerJa":"曜子","speakerEn":"Yoko","ghs":[]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0009:000003f3:text","row":3918,"ordinal":9,"kind":"text","jp":"「…………」","en":"“...”","speakerJa":"桜庭","speakerEn":"Sakuraba","ghs":[]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0009:0000043c:text","row":3919,"ordinal":10,"kind":"text","jp":"「できないわね」","en":"“So much for them.”","speakerJa":"曜子","speakerEn":"Yoko","ghs":[]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0009:00000489:text","row":3920,"ordinal":11,"kind":"text","jp":"「……アンテナが壊れても、部活はできます。放送ができないだけです」","en":"“...A broken antenna doesn’t prevent club activities. It only prevents broadcasting.”","speakerJa":"桜庭","speakerEn":"Sakuraba","ghs":[]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0009:00000508:text","row":3921,"ordinal":12,"kind":"text","jp":"「……意味がないわ」","en":"“...Then the activities are pointless.”","speakerJa":"曜子","speakerEn":"Yoko","ghs":[]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0009:00000559:text","row":3922,"ordinal":13,"kind":"text","jp":"「放送部の活動に、アンテナの修理も含まれるので問題ありません」","en":"“Repairing the antenna falls squarely within the Broadcasting Club’s activities. There is no problem.”","speakerJa":"桜庭","speakerEn":"Sakuraba","ghs":[]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0009:000005d4:text","row":3923,"ordinal":14,"kind":"text","jp":"「……問題あるわ」","en":"“...There is a problem.”","speakerJa":"曜子","speakerEn":"Yoko","ghs":[]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0009:00000623:text","row":3924,"ordinal":15,"kind":"text","jp":"「俺は修理しようと思う」","en":"“I intend to repair it.”","speakerJa":"桜庭","speakerEn":"Sakuraba","ghs":[]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0009:00000678:text","row":3925,"ordinal":16,"kind":"text","jp":"「そう……」","en":"“I see...”","speakerJa":"曜子","speakerEn":"Yoko","ghs":[]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0009:000006c1:text","row":3926,"ordinal":17,"kind":"text","jp":"「さあ、支倉先輩もどうぞ」","en":"“Come on, Hasekura. You can help too.”","speakerJa":"桜庭","speakerEn":"Sakuraba","ghs":[]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0009:00000779:text","row":3927,"ordinal":18,"kind":"text","jp":"「私もやるの？」","en":"“You expect me to do this too?”","speakerJa":"曜子","speakerEn":"Yoko","ghs":[]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0009:000007c6:text","row":3928,"ordinal":19,"kind":"text","jp":"「はい、ここに修理道具もありますから」","en":"“Yes. The repair tools are right here.”","speakerJa":"桜庭","speakerEn":"Sakuraba","ghs":[]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0009:000008ff:text","row":3929,"ordinal":20,"kind":"text","jp":"「ははは～アンテナ修理は楽しいなぁ～♪」","en":"“Ha ha ha! Antenna repair is such fuuun!♪”","speakerJa":"桜庭","speakerEn":"Sakuraba","ghs":[]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0009:00000964:text","row":3930,"ordinal":21,"kind":"text","jp":"「アンアンアン、アンテナ修理で、カレーパン♪」","en":"“An-an-an! Antennas to mend, curry bread at the end!♪”","speakerJa":"桜庭","speakerEn":"Sakuraba","ghs":[]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0009:000009b2:text","row":3931,"ordinal":22,"kind":"text","jp":"「…………」","en":"“...”","speakerJa":"曜子","speakerEn":"Yoko","ghs":[]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0009:000009fb:text","row":3932,"ordinal":23,"kind":"text","jp":"「ん？　これは違う、ここも違う、はまらないな……まあいいか」","en":"“Hm? Not this one. Not here, either. It won’t fit... Oh well.”","speakerJa":"桜庭","speakerEn":"Sakuraba","ghs":[]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0009:00000ad5:text","row":3933,"ordinal":24,"kind":"text","jp":"「あなた、よく分からないのに、修理しようなんてうたったわね」","en":"“You just sang about repairing it when you don’t even know how.”","speakerJa":"曜子","speakerEn":"Yoko","ghs":[]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0009:00000b4e:text","row":3934,"ordinal":25,"kind":"text","jp":"「大丈夫ですよ、何とかなるものです。人生なんて」","en":"“Don’t worry. Things have a way of working out. Life does, anyway.”","speakerJa":"桜庭","speakerEn":"Sakuraba","ghs":[]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0009:00000c1c:text","row":3935,"ordinal":26,"kind":"text","jp":"「…………道具」","en":"“...The tools.”","speakerJa":"曜子","speakerEn":"Yoko","ghs":[]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0009:00000c69:text","row":3936,"ordinal":27,"kind":"text","jp":"「はい？」","en":"“Yes?”","speakerJa":"桜庭","speakerEn":"Sakuraba","ghs":[]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0009:00000cb0:text","row":3937,"ordinal":28,"kind":"text","jp":"「こっちは私が直すから、あなたは頭を使わずに直せるところをいじりなさい」","en":"“I’ll handle this part. You work on something that can be fixed without using your head.”","speakerJa":"曜子","speakerEn":"Yoko","ghs":[]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0009:00000d35:text","row":3938,"ordinal":29,"kind":"text","jp":"「はい」","en":"“Yes.”","speakerJa":"桜庭","speakerEn":"Sakuraba","ghs":[]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0009:00000ff7:text","row":3939,"ordinal":30,"kind":"text","jp":"「……ふぅ。まだまだ先は長いな」","en":"“...Whew. We have a long way to go.”","speakerJa":"桜庭","speakerEn":"Sakuraba","ghs":[]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0009:00001054:text","row":3940,"ordinal":31,"kind":"text","jp":"「先輩、お腹すきませんか？」","en":"“Are you hungry?”","speakerJa":"桜庭","speakerEn":"Sakuraba","ghs":[]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0009:0000110e:text","row":3941,"ordinal":32,"kind":"text","jp":"「別に。お腹が減ってるなら、食べに行ってくれてかまわないわ」","en":"“Not particularly. If you are, you may go eat.”","speakerJa":"曜子","speakerEn":"Yoko","ghs":[]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0009:00001187:text","row":3942,"ordinal":33,"kind":"text","jp":"「修理がすぐ終わるという確信があるなら」","en":"“Provided you’re certain the repairs will finish themselves while you’re gone.”","speakerJa":"曜子","speakerEn":"Yoko","ghs":[]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0009:000011ec:text","row":3943,"ordinal":34,"kind":"text","jp":"「……人生とは谷と山しかない」","en":"“...Life is nothing but downs and ups.”","speakerJa":"桜庭","speakerEn":"Sakuraba","ghs":[]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0009:00001247:text","row":3944,"ordinal":35,"kind":"text","jp":"「何か言った？」","en":"“Did you say something?”","speakerJa":"曜子","speakerEn":"Yoko","ghs":[]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0009:00001294:text","row":3945,"ordinal":36,"kind":"text","jp":"「いえ……」","en":"“No...”","speakerJa":"桜庭","speakerEn":"Sakuraba","ghs":[]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0009:0000144c:text","row":3946,"ordinal":37,"kind":"text","jp":"「こんばんは、桜庭君」","en":"“Good evening, Sakuraba.”","speakerJa":"見里","speakerEn":"Misato","ghs":[]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0009:0000149f:text","row":3947,"ordinal":38,"kind":"text","jp":"「部長先輩……」","en":"“President...”","speakerJa":"桜庭","speakerEn":"Sakuraba","ghs":[]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0009:000014ec:text","row":3948,"ordinal":39,"kind":"text","jp":"「お久しぶりです、支倉さん」","en":"“It’s been a long time, Hasekura.”","speakerJa":"見里","speakerEn":"Misato","ghs":[]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0009:00001545:text","row":3949,"ordinal":40,"kind":"text","jp":"「宮澄……」","en":"“Miyasumi...”","speakerJa":"曜子","speakerEn":"Yoko","ghs":[]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0009:000015ef:text","row":3950,"ordinal":41,"kind":"text","jp":"「おいっす」","en":"“Hey.”","speakerJa":"友貴","speakerEn":"Tomoki","ghs":[]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0009:00001638:text","row":3951,"ordinal":42,"kind":"text","jp":"「友貴もか……」","en":"“Tomoki too...?”","speakerJa":"桜庭","speakerEn":"Sakuraba","ghs":[]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0009:000016e6:text","row":3952,"ordinal":43,"kind":"text","jp":"「なんだよ、嫌そうな感じだな」","en":"“You don’t sound pleased to see me.”","speakerJa":"友貴","speakerEn":"Tomoki","ghs":[]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0009:00001741:text","row":3953,"ordinal":44,"kind":"text","jp":"「いや、そんなことはないぞ」","en":"“No, not at all.”","speakerJa":"桜庭","speakerEn":"Sakuraba","ghs":[]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0009:0000179a:text","row":3954,"ordinal":45,"kind":"text","jp":"「両手に花だが、俺の手には負えない花しかないからな」","en":"“A rose on either arm, and both have enough thorns to finish me.”","speakerJa":"桜庭","speakerEn":"Sakuraba","ghs":[]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0009:0000186c:text","row":3955,"ordinal":46,"kind":"text","jp":"「まあいいや、ほい、差し入れ。カレーパンもあるぞ」","en":"“Whatever. Here—we brought food. Curry bread too.”","speakerJa":"友貴","speakerEn":"Tomoki","ghs":[]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0009:000018db:text","row":3956,"ordinal":47,"kind":"text","jp":"「カレーパンだけでいい、他はいらない」","en":"“Just give me the curry bread. Keep the rest.”","speakerJa":"桜庭","speakerEn":"Sakuraba","ghs":[]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0009:0000193e:text","row":3957,"ordinal":48,"kind":"text","jp":"「二人とも、どうしてここに？」","en":"“Why are you two here?”","speakerJa":"曜子","speakerEn":"Yoko","ghs":[]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0009:000019fa:text","row":3958,"ordinal":49,"kind":"text","jp":"「桜庭君が持って来てくれた写真を見てたら、とても懐かしい気持ちになって……」","en":"“The photograph Sakuraba brought made me feel so nostalgic...”","speakerJa":"見里","speakerEn":"Misato","ghs":[]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0009:00001a83:text","row":3959,"ordinal":50,"kind":"text","jp":"「もしかしたら、ここならと思って」","en":"“I thought this might be where everyone would end up.”","speakerJa":"見里","speakerEn":"Misato","ghs":[]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0009:00001ae2:text","row":3960,"ordinal":51,"kind":"text","jp":"「そう」","en":"“I see.”","speakerJa":"曜子","speakerEn":"Yoko","ghs":[]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0009:00001b88:text","row":3961,"ordinal":52,"kind":"text","jp":"「アンテナ壊れてたんですね」","en":"“The antenna was broken?”","speakerJa":"見里","speakerEn":"Misato","ghs":[]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0009:00001be1:text","row":3962,"ordinal":53,"kind":"text","jp":"「でも、修理してどうするんですか？」","en":"“What are you going to do after repairing it?”","speakerJa":"見里","speakerEn":"Misato","ghs":[]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0009:00001c42:text","row":3963,"ordinal":54,"kind":"text","jp":"「放送です」","en":"“Broadcast.”","speakerJa":"桜庭","speakerEn":"Sakuraba","ghs":[]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0009:00001cec:text","row":3964,"ordinal":55,"kind":"text","jp":"「放送？」","en":"“Broadcast?”","speakerJa":"見里","speakerEn":"Misato","ghs":[]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0009:00001d33:text","row":3965,"ordinal":56,"kind":"text","jp":"「そう、太一に」","en":"“To Taichi.”","speakerJa":"曜子","speakerEn":"Yoko","ghs":[]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0009:00001d80:text","row":3966,"ordinal":57,"kind":"text","jp":"「ぺけくんに？」","en":"“To Peke?”","speakerJa":"見里","speakerEn":"Misato","ghs":[]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0009:00001e2e:text","row":3967,"ordinal":58,"kind":"text","jp":"「ええ、太一の放送は半年も止まってる」","en":"“Yes. Taichi’s signal has been silent for six months.”","speakerJa":"曜子","speakerEn":"Yoko","ghs":[]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0009:00001e91:text","row":3968,"ordinal":59,"kind":"text","jp":"「放送が届いていないことが伝われば、何かが変わるかもしれない」","en":"“If we can tell him his broadcasts aren’t reaching us, something may change.”","speakerJa":"曜子","speakerEn":"Yoko","ghs":[]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0009:00001f6d:text","row":3969,"ordinal":60,"kind":"text","jp":"「うわぁ、いいですね！　私もお手伝いします」","en":"“That’s wonderful! I’ll help too.”","speakerJa":"見里","speakerEn":"Misato","ghs":[]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0009:00002037:text","row":3970,"ordinal":61,"kind":"text","jp":"「ありがとう」","en":"“Thank you.”","speakerJa":"曜子","speakerEn":"Yoko","ghs":[]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0009:00002082:text","row":3971,"ordinal":62,"kind":"text","jp":"「僕も手伝うよ」","en":"“I’ll help.”","speakerJa":"友貴","speakerEn":"Tomoki","ghs":[]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0009:000020cf:text","row":3972,"ordinal":63,"kind":"text","jp":"「ウェルカム」","en":"“Welcome aboard.”","speakerJa":"桜庭","speakerEn":"Sakuraba","ghs":[]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0009:0000211a:text","row":3973,"ordinal":64,"kind":"text","jp":"「工具は……これだな。姉さんはそっちを」","en":"“The tools... Here they are. Sis, take that side.”","speakerJa":"友貴","speakerEn":"Tomoki","ghs":[]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0009:000021e0:text","row":3974,"ordinal":65,"kind":"text","jp":"「はい」","en":"“All right.”","speakerJa":"見里","speakerEn":"Misato","ghs":[]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0009:000025fc:text","row":3975,"ordinal":66,"kind":"text","jp":"「おっと……」","en":"“Whoa...”","speakerJa":"桜庭","speakerEn":"Sakuraba","ghs":[]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0009:00002665:text","row":3976,"ordinal":67,"kind":"text","jp":"「滑るな……」","en":"“Slippery...”","speakerJa":"桜庭","speakerEn":"Sakuraba","ghs":[]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0009:000026b2:text","row":3977,"ordinal":68,"kind":"text","jp":"「はい、どうぞ」","en":"“Here you go.”","speakerJa":"？？？","speakerEn":"???","ghs":[]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0009:000026ff:text","row":3978,"ordinal":69,"kind":"text","jp":"「助かる」","en":"“Thanks.”","speakerJa":"桜庭","speakerEn":"Sakuraba","ghs":[]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0009:00002748:text","row":3979,"ordinal":70,"kind":"text","jp":"「油でツルツルです。カレーパンを食べたら手を拭かないと」","en":"“Your hands are slick with oil. You need to wipe them after eating curry bread.”","speakerJa":"？？？","speakerEn":"???","ghs":[]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0009:000027bd:text","row":3980,"ordinal":71,"kind":"text","jp":"「手を拭いたら匂いが取れてしまう。名残惜しいだろ」","en":"“Then I’d lose the smell. I’d miss it.”","speakerJa":"桜庭","speakerEn":"Sakuraba","ghs":[]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0009:0000282e:text","row":3981,"ordinal":72,"kind":"text","jp":"「はぁ、相変わらずですね」","en":"“Honestly. You haven’t changed.”","speakerJa":"？？？","speakerEn":"???","ghs":[]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0009:000028e6:text","row":3982,"ordinal":73,"kind":"text","jp":"「ん、山辺か」","en":"“Hm? Yamanobe?”","speakerJa":"桜庭","speakerEn":"Sakuraba","ghs":[]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0009:00002931:text","row":3983,"ordinal":74,"kind":"text","jp":"「私だけじゃないですよ、霧ちんも来てます」","en":"“It isn’t just me. Kiri-kins is here too.”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0009:00002b05:text","row":3984,"ordinal":75,"kind":"text","jp":"「こんばんは」","en":"“Good evening.”","speakerJa":"霧","speakerEn":"Kiri","ghs":[]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0009:00002bb1:text","row":3985,"ordinal":76,"kind":"text","jp":"「佐倉も来たの」","en":"“You came too, Sakura.”","speakerJa":"曜子","speakerEn":"Yoko","ghs":[]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0009:00002bfc:text","row":3986,"ordinal":77,"kind":"text","jp":"「……はい。写真を見てたら、いつも美希と一緒だったな……って思って」","en":"“...Yes. Looking at the photographs made me realize I was always with Miki...”","speakerJa":"霧","speakerEn":"Kiri","ghs":[]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0009:00002c7d:text","row":3987,"ordinal":78,"kind":"text","jp":"「美希は、写真を見てたときに霧ちんから電話があったんです」","en":"“Kiri-kins called while I was looking at mine.”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0009:00002d55:text","row":3988,"ordinal":79,"kind":"text","jp":"「そのときに、どうしても会いたくなって」","en":"“And then I just had to see her.”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0009:00002e19:text","row":3989,"ordinal":80,"kind":"text","jp":"「私も……ずっと、会っていなかったから」","en":"“I wanted to see her too... It had been so long.”","speakerJa":"霧","speakerEn":"Kiri","ghs":[]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0009:00002e7e:text","row":3990,"ordinal":81,"kind":"text","jp":"「そうか」","en":"“I see.”","speakerJa":"桜庭","speakerEn":"Sakuraba","ghs":[]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0009:00002f26:text","row":3991,"ordinal":82,"kind":"text","jp":"「霧ちんがこっちに来てくれたので、せっかくだからみんなとも会ってもらおうと思って、宮澄先輩に連絡したんです」","en":"“Since Kiri-kins came all this way, I wanted her to see everyone. So I called Misato.”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0009:00002fcd:text","row":3992,"ordinal":83,"kind":"text","jp":"「そうしたら、ここに来るって言うので……」","en":"“She said she was coming here...”","speakerJa":"霧","speakerEn":"Kiri","ghs":[]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0009:0000314d:text","row":3993,"ordinal":84,"kind":"text","jp":"「えへへ、折角だからみんなで集まったほうがいいかなって思って」","en":"“Hee hee. I thought we might as well gather everyone together.”","speakerJa":"見里","speakerEn":"Misato","ghs":[]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0009:00003229:text","row":3994,"ordinal":85,"kind":"text","jp":"「うんうん」","en":"“Exactly!”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0009:000032d1:text","row":3995,"ordinal":86,"kind":"text","jp":"「こうして集まるのは久しぶりですね」","en":"“It’s been a long time since we were all together like this.”","speakerJa":"霧","speakerEn":"Kiri","ghs":[]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0009:0000344b:text","row":3996,"ordinal":87,"kind":"text","jp":"「いやー、懐かしいなぁ～、あとは……」","en":"“It sure takes me back. Now all we’re missing is...”","speakerJa":"友貴","speakerEn":"Tomoki","ghs":[]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0009:000034ae:text","row":3997,"ordinal":88,"kind":"text","jp":"「あと？　太一は仕方ないだろ」","en":"“Missing? There’s nothing we can do about Taichi.”","speakerJa":"桜庭","speakerEn":"Sakuraba","ghs":[]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0009:00003640:text","row":3998,"ordinal":89,"kind":"text","jp":"「桜庭、私を忘れるなんていい度胸ね」","en":"“Sakuraba. You have some nerve forgetting me.”","speakerJa":"冬子","speakerEn":"Touko","ghs":[]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0009:00003702:text","row":3999,"ordinal":90,"kind":"text","jp":"「あっ、桐原さん、来てくれたんですね」","en":"“Oh! Kirihara, you came.”","speakerJa":"見里","speakerEn":"Misato","ghs":[]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0009:000037c6:text","row":4000,"ordinal":91,"kind":"text","jp":"「ええ、折角ですから」","en":"“Of course. I couldn’t pass this up.”","speakerJa":"冬子","speakerEn":"Touko","ghs":[]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0009:00003819:text","row":4001,"ordinal":92,"kind":"text","jp":"「いや、忘れたわけではない。来ない方がうれし……」","en":"“I didn’t forget you. I was going to say I’d be happier if you hadn’t—”","speakerJa":"桜庭","speakerEn":"Sakuraba","ghs":[]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0009:00003c33:text","row":4002,"ordinal":93,"kind":"text","jp":"「また、つまらぬものを斬ってしまった」","en":"“Once again, I have cut a worthless object.”","speakerJa":"冬子","speakerEn":"Touko","ghs":[]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0009:00003cae:text","row":4003,"ordinal":94,"kind":"text","jp":"「…………」","en":"“...”","speakerJa":"桜庭","speakerEn":"Sakuraba","ghs":[]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0009:00003d58:text","row":4004,"ordinal":95,"kind":"text","jp":"「おーい、生きてるか」","en":"“Hey. Still alive?”","speakerJa":"友貴","speakerEn":"Tomoki","ghs":[]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0009:00003dab:text","row":4005,"ordinal":96,"kind":"text","jp":"「せっかくだ、みんなで作業しないか」","en":"“Since we’re all here, why don’t we work together?”","speakerJa":"桜庭","speakerEn":"Sakuraba","ghs":[]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0009:00003e6d:text","row":4006,"ordinal":97,"kind":"text","jp":"「おっ、起きた」","en":"“Oh, he’s awake.”","speakerJa":"友貴","speakerEn":"Tomoki","ghs":[]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0009:00003f1b:text","row":4007,"ordinal":98,"kind":"text","jp":"「ちっ」","en":"“Tch.”","speakerJa":"冬子","speakerEn":"Touko","ghs":[]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0009:00003fbf:text","row":4008,"ordinal":99,"kind":"text","jp":"「アンテナの修理……ですか？」","en":"“We’re repairing the antenna...?”","speakerJa":"霧","speakerEn":"Kiri","ghs":[]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0009:0000401a:text","row":4009,"ordinal":100,"kind":"text","jp":"「ああ、明日の昼までに直して、放送するんだ、あのときみたいに」","en":"“Yes. We’ll have it working by noon tomorrow, then broadcast just like we did back then.”","speakerJa":"桜庭","speakerEn":"Sakuraba","ghs":[]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0009:000041ae:text","row":4010,"ordinal":101,"kind":"text","jp":"「クロスチャンネルですか？」","en":"“CROSS†CHANNEL?”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0009:00004207:text","row":4011,"ordinal":102,"kind":"text","jp":"「ああ、CROSS†CHANNELだ」","en":"“That’s right. CROSS†CHANNEL.”","speakerJa":"桜庭","speakerEn":"Sakuraba","ghs":[]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0009:0000425e:text","row":4012,"ordinal":103,"kind":"text","jp":"「あっちの世界で自由気ままにやってる太一を、驚かすんだ」","en":"“We’ll give Taichi, living it up in that other world, the surprise of his life.”","speakerJa":"桜庭","speakerEn":"Sakuraba","ghs":[]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0009:00004334:text","row":4013,"ordinal":104,"kind":"text","jp":"「ししょーに？　面白そう～ッ！」","en":"“Master? That sounds fun!”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0009:000043f0:text","row":4014,"ordinal":105,"kind":"text","jp":"「……電波、届くんですか？」","en":"“...Will the signal reach him?”","speakerJa":"霧","speakerEn":"Kiri","ghs":[]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0009:00004449:text","row":4015,"ordinal":106,"kind":"text","jp":"「大事なのは、届くかどうかじゃない。電波（メッセージ）を送ることだ」","en":"“What matters isn’t whether it reaches him. What matters is sending the signal—the message.”","speakerJa":"桜庭","speakerEn":"Sakuraba","ghs":[]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0009:000045e3:text","row":4016,"ordinal":107,"kind":"text","jp":"「カッコつけすぎ」","en":"“Laying it on a bit thick.”","speakerJa":"友貴","speakerEn":"Tomoki","ghs":[]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0009:00004691:text","row":4017,"ordinal":108,"kind":"text","jp":"「……手伝います」","en":"“...I’ll help.”","speakerJa":"霧","speakerEn":"Kiri","ghs":[]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0009:000047f9:text","row":4018,"ordinal":109,"kind":"text","jp":"「仕方ないわね、私も手伝ってあげるわ」","en":"“Fine. I’ll lend a hand too.”","speakerJa":"冬子","speakerEn":"Touko","ghs":[]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0009:000048bd:text","row":4019,"ordinal":110,"kind":"text","jp":"「道具、ありますか？」","en":"“Do we have tools?”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0009:00004971:text","row":4020,"ordinal":111,"kind":"text","jp":"「あっちに置いてあるよ」","en":"“They’re over there.”","speakerJa":"友貴","speakerEn":"Tomoki","ghs":[]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0009:00004a27:text","row":4021,"ordinal":112,"kind":"text","jp":"「はい、霧ちん行こう」","en":"“Come on, Kiri-kins.”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0009:00004d91:text","row":4022,"ordinal":113,"kind":"text","jp":"「……これのネジを締めて…………完成だ！」","en":"“...Tighten this screw... and we’re done!”","speakerJa":"桜庭","speakerEn":"Sakuraba","ghs":[]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0009:00004f33:text","row":4023,"ordinal":114,"kind":"text","jp":"「修理完了ですね！」","en":"“The repairs are complete!”","speakerJa":"見里","speakerEn":"Misato","ghs":[]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0009:00004fe5:text","row":4024,"ordinal":115,"kind":"text","jp":"「まったく、こんなに時間が掛かるなんて」","en":"“I can’t believe that took so long.”","speakerJa":"冬子","speakerEn":"Touko","ghs":[]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0009:000050ab:text","row":4025,"ordinal":116,"kind":"text","jp":"「思いっきり徹夜しちゃいましたね」","en":"“We really stayed up all night.”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0009:00005221:text","row":4026,"ordinal":117,"kind":"text","jp":"「でも、思ったより時間かからなかったですね」","en":"“Still, it went faster than I expected.”","speakerJa":"霧","speakerEn":"Kiri","ghs":[]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0009:0000528a:text","row":4027,"ordinal":118,"kind":"text","jp":"「みんなのおかげですよ」","en":"“Because everyone helped.”","speakerJa":"見里","speakerEn":"Misato","ghs":[]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0009:000052df:text","row":4028,"ordinal":119,"kind":"text","jp":"「あとは、放送するだけ」","en":"“All that remains is the broadcast.”","speakerJa":"桜庭","speakerEn":"Sakuraba","ghs":[]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0009:0000544d:text","row":4029,"ordinal":120,"kind":"text","jp":"「そうね、タイミングもいいかもしれない」","en":"“Yes. The timing may be just right.”","speakerJa":"曜子","speakerEn":"Yoko","ghs":[]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0009:00005513:text","row":4030,"ordinal":121,"kind":"text","jp":"「友貴、放送の準備は」","en":"“Tomoki, are we ready?”","speakerJa":"見里","speakerEn":"Misato","ghs":[]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0009:0000567f:text","row":4031,"ordinal":122,"kind":"text","jp":"「うん、準備できたよ姉さん」","en":"“Everything’s ready, Sis.”","speakerJa":"友貴","speakerEn":"Tomoki","ghs":[]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0009:00005739:text","row":4032,"ordinal":123,"kind":"text","jp":"「ありがとう」","en":"“Thank you.”","speakerJa":"見里","speakerEn":"Misato","ghs":[]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0009:0000589d:text","row":4033,"ordinal":124,"kind":"text","jp":"「さあ、始めましょう」","en":"“Then let’s begin.”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0009:00005951:text","row":4034,"ordinal":125,"kind":"text","jp":"「……でも、最初にお話するのが私でいいんですか？　桜庭君と支倉さんの発案なのに」","en":"“...But should I really be the first to speak? This was Sakuraba and Hasekura’s idea.”","speakerJa":"見里","speakerEn":"Misato","ghs":[]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0009:00005af7:text","row":4035,"ordinal":126,"kind":"text","jp":"「構わない」","en":"“I don’t mind.”","speakerJa":"曜子","speakerEn":"Yoko","ghs":[]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0009:00005b40:text","row":4036,"ordinal":127,"kind":"text","jp":"「こういうときは放送部の部長の言葉で始まらないと」","en":"“Something like this has to begin with the president of the Broadcasting Club.”","speakerJa":"桜庭","speakerEn":"Sakuraba","ghs":[]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0009:00005c10:text","row":4037,"ordinal":128,"kind":"text","jp":"「だから、もうわたしは部長じゃないですよぅ」","en":"“But I’m not the president anymore...”","speakerJa":"見里","speakerEn":"Misato","ghs":[]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0009:00005cda:text","row":4038,"ordinal":129,"kind":"text","jp":"「このメンバーでの部長は、宮澄、あなたよ」","en":"“To this group, you’re still the president, Miyasumi.”","speakerJa":"曜子","speakerEn":"Yoko","ghs":[]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0009:00005d41:text","row":4039,"ordinal":130,"kind":"text","jp":"「それに、太一は宮澄に放送部に誘われたことを、本当に喜んでた」","en":"“And Taichi was truly happy that you invited him into the club.”","speakerJa":"曜子","speakerEn":"Yoko","ghs":[]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0009:00005e1d:text","row":4040,"ordinal":131,"kind":"text","jp":"「もう一度、太一に声をかけてあげて」","en":"“Call out to him one more time.”","speakerJa":"曜子","speakerEn":"Yoko","ghs":[]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0009:00005edf:text","row":4041,"ordinal":132,"kind":"text","jp":"「支倉さん……」","en":"“Hasekura...”","speakerJa":"見里","speakerEn":"Misato","ghs":[]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0009:00005f2c:text","row":4042,"ordinal":133,"kind":"text","jp":"「さあ」","en":"“Go on.”","speakerJa":"曜子","speakerEn":"Yoko","ghs":[]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0009:00005fd2:text","row":4043,"ordinal":134,"kind":"text","jp":"「じゃあ、みんなを代表して、私がこの番組を始めさせていただきます」","en":"“Then, on behalf of everyone, I’ll begin our program.”","speakerJa":"見里","speakerEn":"Misato","ghs":[]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0009:0000632c:text","row":4044,"ordinal":135,"kind":"text","jp":"「本番、五秒前……」","en":"“We’re live in five...”","speakerJa":"霧","speakerEn":"Kiri","ghs":[]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0009:0000637d:text","row":4045,"ordinal":136,"kind":"text","jp":"「──こちらは、群青学院放送部。生きている人、いますか？」","en":"“This is the Gunjo Academy Broadcasting Club. Is anyone alive out there?”","speakerJa":"見里","speakerEn":"Misato","ghs":[]}]}
